From: Jack Kingston <998656+jkingston@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: start the Brick A133 system-control firmware

Load the exact external SCP and service tree after native DRAM training,
export the trained Brick DRAM parameters in the stock ABI, reserve all
firmware-owned memory, and release reset immediately before BL31.

Signed-off-by: Jack Kingston <998656+jkingston@users.noreply.github.com>
---
